title: the Allies are here!
on-arrival: allied_strength += 160; allied_militancy += 2.4
max-visits: 1
view-if: year == 1943 and month == 10

We have recieved news that Allied forces have landed on Sicily. This is obviously good news, but Italy is still far from free. How do we respond?

- @militarise
- @expand
- @raid
- @outreach
- @turncoat
- @nothing

@militarise
title: Militarise
subtitle: Ramp up training to achieve parity with the arriving forces.
unavailable-subtitle: We cannot afford to do this.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: partisans_militancy += 0.5*(1-dissent); resources -= 1
  
@expand
title: Expand
subtitle: Expand our forces to aid the Allies.
unavailable-subtitle: We cannot afford to do this.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: partisans_strength += 50*(1-dissent); partisans_militancy += 0.1*(1-dissent); resources -=1
  
@raid
title: Attack
subtitle: Raid the fascists whilst they are distracted!
unavailable-subtitle: We aren't ready to fight.
choose-if: combat_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {
  Q.combat_resouces += math.round(fascist_militancy*(1-dissent))-1
  Q.fascist_militancy -= 1-dissent
}

@outreach
title: Reach out
subtitle: Reach out to the Allies to secure ammunition, weapons, provisions, etc.
unavailable-subtitle: We cannot afford to do this.
choose-if: resources >= 1
on-arrival: {
  Q.allied_contact = 1
  Q.allied_relation += 5;
  Q.combat_resources += math.round(allied_relation*(1-dissent))
  Q.resources -= 1
}
  
@turncoat
title: Do not let the fatherland fall!
subtitle: This is madness.
view-if: allied_relation < 40
on-arrival: {
  Q.left_dissent *= 20
  Q.center_dissent *= 20
  Q.reformist_dissent *= 10
  Q.fascist_relation += 10
  Q.allied_relation -= 100
  Q.fascist = 1
}
  
@nothing
title: Let the Allies do their thing, they'll be fine.
